# OpenAPI / Swagger

- Treat the spec as a contract: avoid breaking changes unless explicitly requested.
- Prefer additive changes (new fields/endpoints) over renames/removals.
- Keep request/response schemas consistent; reuse components where the repo already does.
- Add/update examples when modifying schemas to make intent unambiguous.
- Call out any breaking changes clearly in the response.
